      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The move does not differentiate enemy and ally: it also hinders Fang Yuan’s newly enslaved flying spider immemorial soul beast. Qing Chou’s purple tongue sword ignores those space layers and pierces through to stab Fang An Lei in the chest after Fang Yuan dodges into the house.",
      "chapters": [
        1518
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
